World.detail:
Israel Condemned argues that Israel's dependence on US support is unsustainable. Israel's government is driven by genocidal mania. Israel's existence relies on foreign funding. Gaza Genocide argues that Israel's actions in Gaza constitute genocide. Gaza is experiencing an ongoing genocide. Israel is targeting civilians in Gaza.

@tadhgdalaigh.bsky.social: “Israel is NOT an ally.”

